Been there, done that, worked fine.  We got OSF/1 running down here and
after some pretty simple tinkering it worked great.  Be sure and turn
the keypad and IBM graphics on in your .nethackrc file and make sure you
are using 8N1 on your modem to get the extended characters.

I never did quite get the mail option to work right.  If you do, though,
you will be able to read mail while in nethack.  I won't spoil what
happens but it's worth the bother.

